source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The bare candidate one rune in is refused by a word rune and kills the opener, so the later brace form pairs with nothing and Jira renders the line literally; jiro keeps it as text.
-- input.jira --
*a*b{*}
-- rendered.html --
<p>*a*b{*}</p>
-- want.md --
\*a\*b{\*}
-- warnings.json --
[]
